{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "2720d0b00cef6206e850437a0dcbef2a81514322ab17d81d70071cd5de0b8ddc", "ja": "輝きのサイン", "zh": "闪耀的Sign", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "07463854a098f8359fa6c8ff9eabf6549608adad633fe5fc95e01d2ef71bfcde", "ja": "役の気持ちに入り込めないまま練習を続けて\nいた未来だったが、通りかかった可奈に悩み\nを相談する。そこで、琴葉が今回のドラマを\n「一緒に成功させたい」と思っている事に\n気付いた未来は、笑顔で劇場へと戻る。", "zh": "未来在练习时一直无法融入角色心境，\n于是找刚好路过的可奈商量。\n过程中，未来发现琴叶的用意在于\n「希望能一起演好这次的电视剧」，\n因此笑容满面地回到剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3909207b4c774c43c8cbe0ae8993a05ab14053beb47625fb4ed3ea11dbe54f93", "ja": "（未来から、今日は公園で練習していると連絡が来た。\n早速、様子を見に来てみたけど……）", "zh": "（接到未来的通知，说她今天在公园里练习，\n于是我赶紧来看看她的状况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "811d205e8bf11d5931e146b0ec27df32dcf1a40d6dd970c3d9c9f8981281ad60", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nおはようございま～す♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n早安～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7e284e88bd417ed8b7e7b693869dfda693d9f096a4690c5fa27d109132d8b549", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "未来，辛苦你了。\n状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "8ed8bbfa6499b04289922acd54c38cb0f0fe010cd8090b5332cd212f0cd24b4d", "ja": "それなんですけど……私、やっぱりどんな気持ちで\nセリフを言ったらいいか、わからないみたいで……。", "zh": "关于这个……\n我好像还是不知道到底该抱着什么感情来说台词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "216c9079e7ff34091c91ef6e3394978a8736563f354a08951167f252957c5007", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうしましょう？\nこのままじゃ、みんなと練習できませんよ～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，怎么办？\n再这样下去，我就不能和大家一起练习了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "60c99bcae796d80ecc7c003fa2dc16956ca41a6b218399a54e848505b49b4a31", "ja": "（未来自身、まだあまり勝ち負けにこだわった事が\nなさそうだからな。でも……）", "zh": "（问题大概是出在未来本身似乎不曾执着于胜负，\n不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3c1e6474debcd8058e931d5ef78d0d73992b643942521428a2a446290a96449b", "ja": "（未来は静香に、投げ出さないと言った。\nせっかくオーディションに受かったんだから、と）", "zh": "（未来对静香说过她不会放弃，\n因为好不容易才通过试镜。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "c058016b3de2d41bcf7283c68c08fd870520e8dab6a1aef1cf7d3f89c834a483", "ja": "ぽかぽか、いい天気～♪\n私はお元気～♪　練習びより～♪", "zh": "暖洋洋的好天气～♪\n我活力满满～♪练习的好日子～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "688103c245da0d7895dd98f35cd5002fdbb0709d52859b113e2dd2df6de05df2", "ja": "あれっ、この声って……？\nあっ、やっぱり可奈だ！　可奈～！", "zh": "咦？这个声音……？\n啊，果然是可奈！可奈～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "cb8aed54beb74cb96d1543e7ea7b33f591e5e597829da29020691ac0724adb0a", "ja": "はれっ？\n未来ちゃんに、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "咦？\n是未来和{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "594be9dbde21e36f9f30806ade409a2e51b47629f543a35215e00c79dcf29965", "ja": "そっか……\n未来ちゃん、悩んでるんだね。", "zh": "这样啊……\n未来你很烦恼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "96843539da46c6be9da304a3f6813235664fbeb9e111adb3e60fe01ccec8ac70", "ja": "うう……。\n私、どうすればいいんだろ～……？", "zh": "呜呜……\n我该怎么做才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3761d41ceca852819500a1ae2d6b5676788f73d7bdab02e5250468bbc5bf2512", "ja": "可奈は、何かアドバイスがあるか？\n自分が練習する上で、気付いた事とか……。", "zh": "可奈，你有什么建议吗？\n像是自己练习时有什么新发现之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "5f3dc4c93bcfc829ebedce7b5cc8db6f8a394380985fc97014a8285103dd8436", "ja": "えっ！　む、難しいなあ～……。\nちょっと待ってください、考えるので！", "zh": "咦！？好、好难喔……\n请稍等，我要想一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "93fd8a0ab96fa4318df21c951fcdcb28674de861f41422c86b5af89141142c1d", "ja": "うーん、アドバイス、アドバイス～。\nナイスなチョイスのアドバイス～♪　……そうだっ！", "zh": "唔～建议、建议～有建设性的建议～♪\n……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "ddfab098a6229f68cffc864e603b34504ceeb9d563c71ebaeb02d4e127345a34", "ja": "なになに！？", "zh": "什么什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "762e764dbb10bfeca70a2d18cc6c755f4dbdc12c5edcdb887be9afe7d0eabb6a", "ja": "あっ、私が考えたことじゃないんだけど。\n初日の練習のあと、志保ちゃんと話したんだ。", "zh": "啊，其实这不是我自己想到的，\n第一天练习结束后，我和志保聊了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "112230dc31f9ac019b5058fb9c41694cf75be39606a4d01fb0498b5af9e8d738", "ja": "私、アイドルとしてがんばるのはいいんだけど……\n勝ち負けっていうの、なんかイヤだな～って。", "zh": "我说在偶像这个领域努力并不是问题……\n但如果要分出胜负就觉得有点讨厌～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "6f8d4e7c1a467fc94c1404a8f4b38dc0a308bda0a3804305f3d8e4215cc87f4e", "ja": "勝ったらうれしいけど……負けたら悔しいし悲しいし、\nそれに、周りとギスギスしちゃいそうで。", "zh": "虽然赢了很开心……但要是输了，就会很不甘心很难过，\n而且气氛也会变得不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "1a24a9d4f768093edcbdbc202dc11a073ceff7e8372bc2abe98e9e8ef149484a", "ja": "そう、そうだよね！\n私も、そういうのやだなーって思ってたんだ！", "zh": "对，就是说嘛！\n我也不喜欢这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a793f1e7dc9833b4b4b224f993eec7a13bdd297a1d1a3f43590ee057b1a92c9d", "ja": "で、可奈。\n志保は何て言ってたんだ？", "zh": "可奈，然后呢？\n志保怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "91c7d318a58a471047da77ab7a645ceb645e874be02acb03c7c1ede71411e547", "ja": "それが……。", "zh": "就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "09b49f9c5742ddda5dc985c704f220e272d449a9c8c321a446df9e989b51608f", "ja": "別に、好きとか嫌いとかの話じゃないと思うけど。\n自分がどうなりたいか、じゃないの？", "zh": "我觉得这不是喜欢或讨厌的问题，\n而是自己的目标是什么吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "e2afee2d9f3ed956dcda2fcbb483825ca7759aea170fe848a1cc42482c802604", "ja": "え？　自分が、どうなりたいか……？", "zh": "咦？自己的目标是什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "ce815289f9ec668c1511d2011d9d864513f7798d6291f58f5d65a4c823b595d2", "ja": "どうしても行きたい場所への切符が1枚しかないなら、\n誰かを押しのけても、奪い取るしかないんじゃない？", "zh": "如果你无论如何都要去的地方只剩一张车票，\n那就算要推开别人，也只能尽力去抢吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "7decec6b3ab82607a9985dbd5ef5df2003d47a2bd98f74d909459dfb91471a9d", "ja": "でも、それは競争相手が憎いんじゃなくて、\n自分が本気でその切符が欲しいってだけの話でしょう。", "zh": "但这不是因为憎恨竞争对手，\n而是单纯因为自己真的很想要那张车票。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "d95715e3bc2d20343ae6966e25abc6334a434e122e580de696f5017c69457b67", "ja": "志保ちゃん……。", "zh": "志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "e623f5026058bb84dc348677b11f4b05e7881c8ba62622fc70fbc1689a67fdb3", "ja": "可奈はどうなの。\n未来の役が可奈だったら、同じように言えないの？", "zh": "那可奈你呢？\n如果让你来演未来的角色，你也会说不出口吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "666ff2adac55c71e25611fb3afd24082cecf6bfd8f069079ce8de6d848515a80", "ja": "その程度の気持ちで、今回のドラマを引き受けたの？\nだったら、私が代わってあげてもいいわよ。", "zh": "你只凭这点决心就接下这次的电视剧了吗？\n那要我代替你演也没关系喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "08a0aea523875276a261fc600581b210ab13a43ebf17666c19c678b4f922fc0b", "ja": "そ、それは違うよ！　私……私だって\nこのオーディション、がんばって受かったんだもん！", "zh": "才、才不是这样！\n我……我也是很努力才通过这次试镜的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "54c944b6e1d04e8a35a681c0aaad31dadd4dd00f8e7cf093a00df9cd11d7ae0c", "ja": "だから志保ちゃんより上手にできなかったとしても、\n絶対に譲れない！　……あっ。", "zh": "所以就算我没办法演得比志保更好，\n也绝对不会把角色让给你！……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "fd8e82374469e85025df2ad454541fdd641838360e6595d81bff00ff17adc874", "ja": "そう。\n……なら、そうすればいいと思うけど。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……那你就这样做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "8eafff06a8e89378399b32e11d41f8b5c0dcd28ed309e8aad94b72e996cd4616", "ja": "志保ちゃんて、やっぱりすごいよねー。\n私、一生敵わないかもって思っちゃった。", "zh": "志保果然很厉害呢～\n我觉得自己可能一辈子都赢不了她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "1633c14f949fa4f686328ad3df6d1dafe8039e16506332439d4f2f54d00859dc", "ja": "でもね！　私、思ったんだ。\nそれでも、あきらめたくない……って。", "zh": "但是啊！我那时候就觉得，\n即使如此，我也不想放弃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "17eaf5376e22d7e640ab1a02fe3e23778de58e01b7add69435c40f55878af69f", "ja": "どこかひとつでも～！　志保ちゃんより、\nすごいアイドルになりたい！　た～い！", "zh": "就算只有一个地方赢她也没关系～！\n我想成为比志保更厉害的偶像！偶像～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e4704ea65337c3997f0a63b8c0b1591e1e8e32dd91eae7de9759c4933e04177", "ja": "可奈……。", "zh": "可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "6590e3739c85e3f69f12d5dde63cec29843e8ed2fac6eeb4ce688ab8dc7e833f", "ja": "えへへ……\n未来ちゃんも、そういう風に思うこと、ない？", "zh": "嘿嘿……\n未来，你没这么想过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "3f6d06091b8e1f13d0cf5d290fc840caad682fef8c3b5d17911317dc5450227c", "ja": "……ある！\n私、アイドルがすごく、すーっごく好きだから！", "zh": "……有！\n因为我超喜欢、超──喜欢偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "9215633618a030102799e42567948ca36cbbea655bc47d3249de4c8cd38d8472", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんや、春香さんみたいな……\nううん、もっとすごいアイドルに、私もなりたい！", "zh": "我想成为像琴叶、春香……\n不，是比她们更厉害的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "1f3ced2eb815eaf33e3f6821a5daa257fc29ea5c6867f289854ea0a1f5087d9d", "ja": "そうだな。未来は今のその気持ちを、\nセリフに込めればいいんだと思う。", "zh": "没错，未来你把现在的心情放进台词，\n我想就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "5d2298b232f0143e5edeb1917e9a4c85baa1dd09088417df4829fde72dfc9c0e", "ja": "ライバルだから嫌いにならなきゃいけない、\nなんて事はない。劇場の仲間なら、むしろその逆だ。", "zh": "并不会因为是劲敌，就一定要讨厌对方。\n如果是剧场的伙伴，那正好相反。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "c727a8b8c7bebeda32dc79f76d09ea41552090282b2b6958d8230221b49dd6fb", "ja": "ええっと……好きだけど、ライバル？\nううん。好きだから、ライバルってことかな？", "zh": "呃呃……虽然喜欢，却是劲敌？\n不对，是因为喜欢所以是劲敌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "700034a41d09ab149ed3d585c75a5a65b274e2f6c7682c05dc3a01cf8fe4b574", "ja": "うん。琴葉さんが未来ちゃんに言ったことも、\n今回のドラマを成功させるためだもんね。", "zh": "嗯，琴叶也是为了把这次的电视剧演好，\n才对未来说那些话的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "36d55579fccda5e8ec94087ac94522203887a944f9691e245a7247c67e2e1c07", "ja": "そうだな。琴葉は、お芝居が大好きだからな。\n本気でやらないとダメだって、気づいたんだろう。", "zh": "没错，因为琴叶最喜欢演戏了。\n她应该是发现一定要认真去演才能交出好成绩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1044_014mir", "source_sha256": "56b52b304bfec7d80947c017492abe7ab1f5078e28c3bba2f04189af6e8cee59", "ja": "そっかぁ……だから琴葉ちゃん、\nあんなに厳しかったんだ……。", "zh": "这样啊……\n所以琴叶才会那么严厉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "e83fea4feedae4725a30ec142338f51c5dd1e29c349351b74ae3d36702b54d6a", "ja": "どうだ、未来。\n今度は思いきって、やれそうか？", "zh": "怎么样，未来？\n这次能尽全力去演了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "f282ef05f9d738b464585a72ab0a4c5fb3738394f195923ced2c4aae78f19c3c", "ja": "はいっ！　私、お芝居はまだへたっぴだけど……\n大好きだったら、琴葉ちゃんにも負けません！", "zh": "没问题！虽然我的演技还很差劲……\n但说到喜欢的心，我可不会输给琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "9bcedc7816719b513e7320aa93c65b29db66320a5ef950e4255cbd0dfac143f0", "ja": "よかった！\nそれじゃ、早速劇場に戻って練習を……ん？", "zh": "太好了！\n那我们赶紧回剧场练习……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "f5db5a0f65a6173706ad4f813d235ab7e7d7cf39d51f3257e188d6555b0e13ad", "ja": "あっ。\n…………。", "zh": "啊。\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "93c4cf75346506e82a0d83a4724fbe332b876a5cba98f6216e741c45267e5cde", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "53f12765a7a2ac1152382c42c03c84ac749ad431b2b5a9bd4b3dcfffb333722b", "ja": "いや、なんでもないよ。\nふたりとも、劇場に戻ろう。", "zh": "不，没事。\n我们回剧场去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1051_014mir", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1052_036kan", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "0f2a5cc6f16ea425f45d0f329c12ef3b7f24d6123cfd15ee499abad82fd04cec", "ja": "（……顛末は、琴葉に教えなくても大丈夫そうだ。\n撮影開始まであと少し……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（……看来不用和琴叶说明事情始末了。\n再过不久就要开拍……真令人期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
